---
import InteriorLayout from '../../layouts/InteriorLayout.astro';
---

<InteriorLayout
  title="Sponsor — Juneteenth Conference 2026"
  description="Become a sponsor of Juneteenth Conference 2026. Support Black excellence in tech with packages from $500 to $7,500."
  current="Sponsor"
  heroTitle="Sponsor"
  heroSubtitle="Invest in Black excellence in tech"
  heroAccent="gold"
>
  <section class="interior-section">
    <div class="interior-content">
      <div class="reveal-stagger">
        <p class="reveal section-lede">
          Your sponsorship helps produce a world-class conference and funds year-round programs addressing the Digital Divide through mentorship, scholarship, and professional readiness for Black professionals in tech.
        </p>

        <p class="reveal donation-note">
          Approximately 60% of your sponsorship is a tax-deductible charitable donation through our fiscal sponsor, YPOC Harrisburg (501(c)(3)). The remaining 40% covers direct sponsor benefits.
        </p>

        <div class="reveal tier-grid">
          <div class="tier-card tier-signature">
            <span class="tier-name">Signature</span>
            <span class="tier-price">$7,500</span>
            <ul class="tier-perks">
              <li>Prominent logo on all conference materials &amp; website</li>
              <li>Logo in monthly newsletter (2,500+ subscribers) for 12 months</li>
              <li>Video splash during session transitions</li>
              <li>Booth in central hall</li>
              <li>Access to networking events</li>
              <li>5 full-access tickets</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <div class="tier-card tier-community">
            <span class="tier-name">Community</span>
            <span class="tier-price">$5,000</span>
            <ul class="tier-perks">
              <li>Logo on conference materials</li>
              <li>Logo video splash during transitions</li>
              <li>Booth in central hall</li>
              <li>Access to networking events</li>
              <li>2 full-access tickets</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <div class="tier-card tier-stage">
            <span class="tier-name">Stage</span>
            <span class="tier-price">$2,500</span>
            <ul class="tier-perks">
              <li>Logo on conference materials</li>
              <li>Booth in central hall</li>
              <li>Access to networking events</li>
              <li>1 full-access ticket</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <div class="tier-card tier-contributing">
            <span class="tier-name">Contributing</span>
            <span class="tier-price">$1,000</span>
            <ul class="tier-perks">
              <li>Logo on conference materials</li>
              <li>Access to networking events</li>
              <li>1 full-access ticket</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <div class="tier-card tier-friend">
            <span class="tier-name">Friend</span>
            <span class="tier-price">$500</span>
            <ul class="tier-perks">
              <li>Name on conference website</li>
              <li>1 full-access ticket</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <div class="tier-card tier-inkind">
            <span class="tier-name">In-Kind</span>
            <span class="tier-price">Varies</span>
            <ul class="tier-perks">
              <li>Donation of goods or services that support the conference</li>
              <li>Recognition on conference materials</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="reveal cta-block">
          <h3 class="cta-heading">Ready to partner with us?</h3>
          <p class="cta-text">We'd love to discuss how your organization can be part of Juneteenth Conference 2026.</p>
          <a href="mailto:info@juneteenthconf.com?subject=Sponsorship%20Inquiry" class="cta-primary" style="margin-top: 20px;">Get in Touch</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</InteriorLayout>

<style>
  .interior-section {
    padding: 60px 24px 80px;
    background: #231c2d;
  }
  .interior-content {
    max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto;
  }
  .section-lede {
    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
    font-size: clamp(17px, 2vw, 21px);
    color: rgba(240, 237, 230, 0.7);
    line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 24px;
  }
  .donation-note {
    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
    font-size: 14px; color: rgba(240, 237, 230, 0.45);
    line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 48px;
    padding: 16px 20px;
    border-left: 3px solid rgba(212, 168, 67, 0.3);
    background: rgba(45, 36, 56, 0.3);
    border-radius: 0 6px 6px 0;
  }
  .tier-grid {
    display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    gap: 20px; margin-bottom: 56px;
  }
  .tier-card {
    background: rgba(45, 36, 56, 0.4);
    border: 1px solid rgba(240, 237, 230, 0.08);
    border-radius: 8px; padding: 28px;
  }
  .tier-signature {
    border-color: rgba(212, 168, 67, 0.3);
    grid-column: 1 / -1;
  }
  .tier-name {
    font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif;
    font-weight: 700; font-size: 14px;
    color: #D4A843; text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em; display: block; margin-bottom: 4px;
  }
  .tier-price {
    font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif;
    font-weight: 700; font-size: 32px;
    color: #f0ede6; display: block; margin-bottom: 16px;
  }
  .tier-signature .tier-price { font-size: 40px; }
  .tier-perks {
    list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;
  }
  .tier-perks li {
    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
    font-size: 14px; color: rgba(240, 237, 230, 0.5);
    line-height: 1.6; padding: 4px 0 4px 16px;
    position: relative;
  }
  .tier-perks li::before {
    content: ''; position: absolute; left: 0; top: 12px;
    width: 6px; height: 6px; border-radius: 50%;
    background: rgba(212, 168, 67, 0.4);
  }
  .cta-block {
    text-align: center; padding-top: 16px;
  }
  .cta-heading {
    font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif;
    font-weight: 700; font-size: 24px;
    color: #f0ede6; margin-bottom: 12px;
  }
  .cta-text {
    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
    font-size: 16px; color: rgba(240, 237, 230, 0.55);
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .tier-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .tier-signature { grid-column: auto; }
  }
</style>
